{"hw":"ἥλιος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἥλιος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἥλιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἠέλιος</span>, as always in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> (exc. in the late passage <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.271</span> </span>) and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alim.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀέλιος</span> <span class=\"gk\">[α]</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.144</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Call.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cer.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">92</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lav.Pall.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">89</span> </span>, and lyr. in Trag., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">809</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">175</span> </span>, al., but <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἅλιος</span> <span class=\"gk\">[α]</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">96</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</s