-scope\">2.36</span> </span>; identified with Apollo, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Carm.Pop.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">781.11</span> </span>; with Dionysus, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.Chr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31.11</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">Ἡλίου ἀστήρ</span>, of the planet <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Saturn</cite>, <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Epin.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">987c</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.30</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theo Sm.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.130H.</span> </span> (I.-<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sāwelios</b>, cf. Cret. <span class=\"gk\">ἀβέλιος</span>, Lith. <b class=\"lex-tr\">sáulė</b>, Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">sōl.</b>)</div></div>"}